2. Benefits of vibe coding
🚀 Faster development

AI can quickly generate:

Boilerplate code
CRUD applications
API endpoints
Database models
User interfaces
Forms
Authentication systems
Tests
Documentation

A feature that might take hours to manually scaffold can potentially be started in minutes.

======================

🧠 Reduces repetitive work

Instead of repeatedly writing similar code, you can ask AI to generate it.

For example:

Create CRUD endpoints for products with validation, pagination, and error handling.

This lets you spend more time on:

Business requirements
Architecture
User experience
Security
Product strategy

============================
📚 Helps you learn faster

AI can explain unfamiliar code:

Explain this function line by line.

=========================
⚡ Rapid prototyping

Vibe coding is excellent for building:

MVPs
Internal tools
Proofs of concept
Landing pages
Automation scripts
Small SaaS prototypes

============================

🤖 Dependency hallucinations

AI may recommend:

Packages that don't exist
Incorrect API methods
Outdated documentation
Deprecated libraries

Always verify dependencies before adding them.

